@startuml MassagePaw_IBD
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName Monospace
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title MassagePaw — Internal Block Diagram (IBD)\nData & Control Flows

' Operator side
component "OperatorGlove\n[IMU × 6, Haptic × 10]" as Glove
component "OperatorStation\nworkstation" as OpStation

' Comms
component "TeleOpLink\nUDP/5G/WiFi6\nAES-256 · ≤20 ms" as Link

' Robot side
component "NetworkAdapter\n[robot]" as NetAdapt
component "OnboardComputer\n[RT Linux · 8-core]" as OBC
component "SafetyModule\n[force≤5N · watchdog100ms]" as Safety
component "MotorController\n[20ch · 1kHz]" as MC
component "ForceTorqueSensor\n[6-DoF wrist]" as FTS

component "Thumb\n[4 joints]" as Thumb
component "IndexFinger\n[3 joints]" as Idx
component "MiddleFinger\n[3 joints]" as Mid
component "RingFinger\n[3 joints]" as Ring
component "PinkyFinger\n[3 joints]" as Pnk

component "Palm TactileArray\n[4 × TactileSensor]" as PalmT
component "Fingertip Sensors\n[TactileSensor × 5]" as FTips

' ── Flows ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Glove      --> OpStation   : OperatorPose\n(IMU fusion)
OpStation  --> Link        : CommandPacket\n200 Hz
Link       --> NetAdapt    : encrypted UDP
NetAdapt   --> OBC         : CommandPacket

OBC        --> Safety      : raw cmd
Safety     --> MC          : gated cmd\n(force_scale clamped)
MC         --> Thumb       : joint angle targets
MC         --> Idx         : joint angle targets
MC         --> Mid         : joint angle targets
MC         --> Ring        : joint angle targets
MC         --> Pnk         : joint angle targets

Thumb      --> MC          : actual angle + torque
Idx        --> MC          : actual angle + torque
Mid        --> MC          : actual angle + torque
Ring       --> MC          : actual angle + torque
Pnk        --> MC          : actual angle + torque

FTips      --> OBC         : pressure map\n500 Hz
PalmT      --> OBC         : pressure map\n500 Hz
FTS        --> OBC         : wrist F/T\n1 kHz

OBC        --> NetAdapt    : StatusPacket\n100 Hz
NetAdapt   --> Link        : encrypted UDP
Link       --> OpStation   : StatusPacket
OpStation  --> Glove       : haptic vibration\n(forceReading)

Safety     ..> OBC         : ESTOP signal\n(dashed = emergency path)

note right of Safety
  <b>REQ-002</b> enforced here:
  contactForce > 5 N
  → clamp force_scale
  → trigger SAFETY_HOLD
end note

note right of OBC
  <b>REQ-005</b> enforced here:
  no cmd > 100 ms
  → EMERGENCY_STOP
end note

@enduml
